%% Life of one work item. GitHub renders .mmd files.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> INTAKE: issue labelled, ticket, web form, API, schedule
  INTAKE --> INTENT: foreman picks the start phase
  INTAKE --> SPEC: simple item, skip intent
  INTENT --> NEEDS_INPUT: agent asks a question
  NEEDS_INPUT --> INTENT: answered in the Inbox
  INTENT --> SPEC: triage done
  SPEC --> AWAITING_SPEC_APPROVAL: spec written, draft PR opened
  AWAITING_SPEC_APPROVAL --> SPEC: changes requested
  AWAITING_SPEC_APPROVAL --> BUILD: approved by a person
  BUILD --> AWAITING_GATE: extra gate by risk
  AWAITING_GATE --> BUILD: changes requested
  BUILD --> VERIFY: code pushed
  AWAITING_GATE --> VERIFY: approved (gate after build)
  VERIFY --> BUILD: findings, send back to executor
  VERIFY --> AWAITING_GATE: extra gate after verify, for example a database review
  AWAITING_GATE --> SHIP: approved (gate after verify)
  VERIFY --> SHIP: checks and evidence pass
  SHIP --> AWAITING_HANDOFF: pull request ready for review
  AWAITING_HANDOFF --> BUILD: changes requested
  AWAITING_HANDOFF --> COMPLETE: approved, a person merges
  INTENT --> BLOCKED: stopped, timed out or over budget
  BUILD --> BLOCKED: stopped, timed out or over budget
  BLOCKED --> BUILD: Retry (resumes the phase that was paused)
  BLOCKED --> FAILED: gave up
  INTAKE --> CANCELLED: cancelled by a person
  COMPLETE --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
